### `crates/syntax/src/syntax_node.rs`

Before:

```rust
    pub fn flat(&self) -> &Arc<FlatTree> {
        &self.0
    }
}
```

After:

```rust
    pub fn flat(&self) -> &Arc<FlatTree> {
        &self.0
    }

    /// The tree, when this is the last count of it.
    pub(crate) fn into_unique(self) -> Option<FlatTree> {
        Arc::into_inner(self.0)
    }
}
```

